MANUAL_ONLY=true
TITLE=E2E-72: MCP — session billing dedup (30-minute window)
TAGS=mcp,billing,correctness
MODE=mcp
BODY=On a paid installation, call review_diff repeatedly with the same sessionId and confirm repeat calls at or below the session max bill 0, a costlier call bills only the positive delta, a new sessionId bills in full, the 30-minute window expiry resets billing, omitting sessionId disables dedup without erroring, and the iteration counter tracks the true call count. No fixture PR.
